  "write_api": [
    {
      "path": "scripts/lib/intake-radar/cloudflare.mjs",
      "symbol": "authTokenFromWrangler"
    }
  ],
  "parity_test": "scripts/lib/intake-radar/cloudflare.node-test.mjs",
  "allowed_consumers": [
    "scripts/lib/intake-radar/cloudflare.mjs",
    "scripts/lib/intake-radar/cloudflare.node-test.mjs"
  ],
  "since": "2026-10-25",
  "notes": "所有反馈雷达 bearer token 只由官方 npx wrangler auth token --json 提供；Wrangler 自己负责 macOS/Linux/Windows 的配置、keyring、旧目录优先级和 OAuth refresh。错误只给登录或重试下一步，不回显 token、refresh token、key/email。"
